कु—स्मय Nom. Ā. ˚यते, to smile improperly, Dhātup. xxxiii, 37;
to see mentally, guess, ib.;
to perceive, imagine, ib.

cl. 9. P. कुष्णाति (ind.p. कुषित्वा, Pāṇ. i, 2, 7; aor. अकोषीत्, Pāṇ., Sch.),
to tear asunder, Bhaṭṭ.;
to pinch, Car. i, 8; VP. iii, 12, 9;
to force or draw out, extract, Bhaṭṭ.;
to knead Comm. on KātyŚr. (perf. p. कुषित);
to test, examine (?);
to shine (?) : cl. 6. कुषति, to gnaw, nibble, BhP. iii, 16, 10 :
Pass. कुष्यति and ˚ते, ‘to weigh, balance’ [NBD.], Pāṇ. iii, 1, 90.
